From 4591aecb214546f0be118edd169d3a92e07b22e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Lam <matthew.lam@openrouter.ai>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:21:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Make pstack tool-neutral

Five fixes only: point every model-roles read and write at
plugins/pstack/models.md (with Matthew's roles), run a role whose model the
tool can't select natively with codex exec -m <slug>, name Claude Code and
Codex transcript paths next to the Cursor ones, offer the repo's verify-*
skill / driver next to control-cli and control-ui, and name the repo's
review bots (e.g. Bugbot, Devin, perry) where pstack triages Bugbot. All
other pstack wording stays verbatim.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
